# Code owners for restaurant-ops-platform. GitHub auto-requests review from these handles
# when a PR touches the matching paths. Combined with the "1 approval required"
# branch protection ruleset, this means owners get pinged automatically.
#
# Syntax: <path pattern>  <github-handle> [<github-handle>...]
# Last matching line wins.

# Default owner — anything not explicitly listed.
# TODO: add teammate's GitHub handle here once known, e.g.:
#   *  @example-org @teammate-handle
*  @example-org

# Infra / CI / ops — only @example-org for now (teammate is SaaS-friendly, not
# expected to operate self-hosted infra; teammate notifications still go
# via Slack, see team_ops_preference memory).
/.github/                          @example-org
/docker-compose*.yml               @example-org
/apps/kds-api/Dockerfile           @example-org
/apps/kds-web/Dockerfile           @example-org
/apps/analytics-api/Dockerfile     @example-org
/apps/backoffice-web/Dockerfile    @example-org

# Database schema — high blast radius, sole owner reviews schema changes.
/packages/db-kds/prisma/           @example-org
